      "The organizations getting this right are not the ones banning AI or the ones ignoring the risk. They are the ones treating data-to-AI as a governed flow like any other: discover what is happening, classify the data, route each class to an approved and appropriate destination, keep the most sensitive paths under their own control, and log it all. That is how you get the productivity of AI without quietly leaking the company into someone else's model.",
